==English==
===Etymology===
[[penta-|pent(a)-]] + [[polyomino|(poly)omino]]

===Noun===
{{wikipedia}}
'''pentomino''' (''plural'' '''pentominoes''')

#{{geometry}} A [[polyomino]] made up of five squares.

